      'The point is not to collect APIs for the sake of it. The point is to compare sources that normally sit in different worlds. A geopolitical event might affect oil. A shipping signal might affect supply chains. A Reddit narrative might show retail attention forming before price fully moves. A prediction market might move before traditional media catches up.',
